    "title": "NewsON - Local News & Weather",
    "description": "Watch local TV newscasts live & on demand for FREE from 285+ trusted local news stations across the U.S all in one app. Stay up to date on local news with NewsON anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\n- Stream live local news, previous newscasts (up to 48 hours), and local news clips\r\n- Watch breaking news coverage of local stories gaining national attention from where it\u2019s happening\r\n-  Never miss a moment - get breaking news alerts and easily identify when stations are broadcasting live\r\n- Access your favorite local stations effortlessly no matter where you live\r\n\r\n\r\nFor app feedback, support, and questions, contact us at info@newson.us",
